d’un sol propice à la survie de leur espèce.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"Dandelion's Odyssey","overview":"Two dandelion balls are the only survivors of a series of nuclear explosions that are destroying the Earth. At the end of their odyssey, they will find a new soil for the survival of their species.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"Dmuchawce","overview":"Dendelion, Baraban, Leonto i Taraxa, cztery mniszki lekarskie, które przetrwały serię eksplozji nuklearnych niszczących Ziemię, zostają wyrzucone w kosmos. Po utknięciu na nieznanej planecie, wyruszyli na poszukiwanie gleby nadającej się do przetrwania ich gatunku. Jednakże żywioły, fauna, flora i klimat — wszystko to stanowią pułapki, które będą musieli pokonać.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"민들레의 오디세이","overview":"모모코 세토의 과학 애니메이션 〈민들레의 오디세이〉는 시간과 스케일을 자유롭게 변주하며 미시적 세계를 거대한 우주처럼 그려낸다. 영화는 성운과 별로 가득한 은하계를 비추며 시작되지만, 곧 그것이 하나의 민들레에서 날아오른 씨앗 무리였음이 드러나며 인상적인 시각적 반전을 선사한다. 260일간의 타임랩스 촬영, 실사와 3D의 결합으로 눈에 보이지 않는 생명의 세계를 섬세하게 포착한 이 작품은 <플래닛 시리즈>보다 서사성과 의인화를 강화하고, 민들레 씨앗들의 여정을 통해 생존과 끈기라는 주제를 감성적으로 풀어낸다.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"TW","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"蒲公英的奇幻漂流","overview":"核爆過後，地球葬身火海。四顆蒲公英種子奇蹟似地毫髮無傷，乘著仍蓬鬆的白色種子頭，被吸進浩瀚宇宙，踏上探險旅程。在飽受氣候摧殘的星球上，它們是否能找到可以重新生存扎根的新家園呢？","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"星球","overview":"　这个故事讲述了四颗蒲公英种子（或称瘦果）的惊险旅程。它们在核弹摧毁原野的千钧一发之际逃脱，随着爆炸气流冲入太空。在太空中漂流时与一只海星相遇后，这些种子降落在一个陌生星球，开始寻找扎根之地。四位非典型移民者就此展开了一场漫长的漂泊之旅——从冰封雪原到栖息着危险昆虫的植物世界，穿越马铃薯岛屿随波漂浮的奇异海洋。最终，当它们穿越三颗月亮照耀下的后末日沙漠时，幸得一只孤儿蛞蝓的友谊相助，瘦果们终于在这片废土上找到了新家园。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"","overview":"Dendelion, Baraban, Léonto und Taraxa, vier Löwenzahnsamen, die die nuklearen Explosionen überlebt haben, die die Erde zerstören, werden in den Kosmos geschleudert. Nachdem sie auf einem unbekannten Planeten gestrandet sind, machen sie sich auf die Suche nach einem Boden, der für das Überleben ihrer Spezies geeignet ist. Doch die Elemente, die Fauna, die Flora und das Klima stellen ihnen zahlreiche Hindernisse in den Weg. Eine Odyssee in einer mikroskopisch kleinen, imaginären Welt voller Emotionen, die die Herausforderungen der Umweltmigration thematisiert. Eine Geschichte über die Schwierigkeit, ein Zuhause zu finden, ein Gebiet, in dem man sich niederlassen kann.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Одиссея одуванчика","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"Dandelion's Odyssey","overview":"De helden zijn de pluisjes van de nederige paardenbloem. Nadat de aarde is vernietigd, beginnen zij aan een ongewilde interplanetaire reis. Via een zwart gat belanden ze op een bevroren planeet, op zoek naar een nieuw thuis. De planeet ontdooit, zaden ontspruiten, insecten komen tot leven. Langzaam ontstaat een nieuwe groene wereld - uitnodigend, gevaarlijk en vol avontuur.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"MX","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"El gran viaje","overview":"Rescatados de la aniquilación nuclear de la Tierra, cuatro amigos se estrellan en un planeta desconocido y parten valientemente en busca de un nuevo hogar para su especie.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"La odisea de Dandelion","overview":"Dendelion, Baraban, Léonto y Taraxa son cuatro dientes de león, sobreviven milagrosamente a una guerra nuclear que destruye la Tierra y se encuentran lanzados al cosmos, varados en un planeta desconocido, en busca de un suelo adecuado para la supervivencia de su especie. Pero los elementos, la fauna, la flora y el clima son sólo algunos de los obstáculos que deben superar.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"蒲公英的奇幻漂遊","overview":"核爆過後，地球再難立足。四顆同屬一朵蒲公英的種子被拋進宇宙，漂泊陌生星球，歷盡冰旱、風雨、奇異生態。他們要做的事很單純：找到一塊能扎根、讓同類繼續活下去的土壤。 延時攝影、微距實拍場景與 3D 動畫交疊，把苔蘚、蘑菇和昆蟲拍成巨大的風景。「遊籽」沒有話兒，惟奧斯卡金像級聲音設計讓風、水、動植物都像在說話。日籍導演瀨戶桃子自幼在東京就讀法語學校，將難以歸屬的自覺拍成首部動畫長片，反覆問道：被拔起之後，還能不能重新落地？四顆種子走散、再聚，像一切被迫遷移的生命——舉重若輕，卻不肯散盡。","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"M0intXvCmso","site":"YouTube","type":"Behind the Scenes","name":"Making Planètes, l'art de façonner des mondes","iso_639_1":"fr","official":false,"published_at":"2026-03-08T09:48:34.000Z","size":1080},{"key":"Y4ucI60lK_M","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"PLANETES  | Bande Annonce Officielle","iso_639_1":"fr","official":true,"published_at":"2025-10-28T09:13:43.000Z","size":1080}],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/6aj55ZHI4bqTyY32gApKixLoJli.jpg","width":1359,"height":2039,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/7iANFgxFGX9iXq2Bcbd46JDicHC.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/4EbiJTqpKCM4Cmj7Xpsji38mW9A.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/3WzSOsrz90sWMAHlQvRerV6dFEs.jpg","width":1085,"height":1610,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/pz6FwuIqXLuxL3TMgdtEhsJbE9G.jpg","width":500,"height":750,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/4brlVcs4DC2sHw5vhcBLlcb6thB.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/3udaZHThsjOjcRtTxgdFhyIOd17.jpg","width":2000,"height":2667,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/qwUKfCr26nNOjCiUZ0YYBTaVBHG.jpg","width":960,"height":1280,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"backdrops":[{"file_path":"/9BAuak729Z4OoXI6R6E5lw5Qx0L.jpg","width":3200,"height":1800,"iso_639_1":null,"vote